[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:65. Not a Baby]
[00:00.360]Lesson 65 | 第65课
[00:02.385]What are you going to do this evening, Betty? | 贝蒂，你今晚打算做什么？
[00:06.650]I'm going to meet some friends, Dad. | 爸，我打算去见些朋友。
[00:10.540]You mustn't come home late. | 你可不许晚回家。
[00:14.370]You must be home at half past ten. | 你必须在十点半以前到家。
[00:18.135]I can't get home so early, Dad. | 爸，我不能那么早回家。
[00:22.470]Can I have the key to the front door, please? | 我能要前门的钥匙吗？
[00:27.000]No, you can't. | 不，不行。
[00:29.880]Betty's 18 years old, Tom. | 汤姆，贝蒂已经18岁了。
[00:34.435]She's not a baby. | 她不是小孩子。
[00:36.560]Give her the key. | 把钥匙给她。
[00:38.430]She always comes home early. | 她总是早回家。
[00:41.185]Oh, all right. | 哦，好吧。
[00:44.240]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:46.630]But you mustn't come home after a quarter past eleven. | 但是你不能在十一点一刻以后回家。
[00:52.105]Do you hear? | 你听见了吗？
[00:53.750]Yes, Dad. | 听见了，爸。
[00:56.145]Thanks, Mum. | 谢谢你，妈。
[00:58.345]That's all right, dear. | 没关系，亲爱的。
[01:00.660]Goodbye, enjoy yourself. | 再见，玩得开心。
[01:03.750]We always enjoy ourselves, Mum. | 妈，我们总是玩得很开心的。
[01:07.065]Bye bye. | 再见。